    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109644" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτί-ασμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is laid back,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτιάσματα χερῶν</span>
			<i>attitudes of supplication</i> with hands <i>upstretched,</i>
