				<u>Pr.</u>
				1005
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. κειμένου πατρός</span> his
			father's <i>body</i> as it lies <i>supine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1285
			</span></i>.</div>
